            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Carrie C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "As written these are bland. I really like garlic. While I was steam drying my potatoes, I added a stick of butter and 6 cloves of minced garlic to the pan. Cooked til fragrant then added the milk to heat it up. Added the potatoes back in and then mashed them. I did triple the recipe to feed my crew.",
            "datePublished": "2020-04-29T12:56:45.020Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
