            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Blessed Baker"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These potatoes were delicious. I used an additional clove of garlic, only half the amount of salt, and 1 tsp. of dried parsley (because I didn't have fresh). I had to add a little extra milk than the recipe called for to get the potatoes creamy. Easy to make and much better than the boxed stuff. I will make again.",
            "datePublished": "2020-04-13T22:54:56.783Z"
          },
          {
