            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mwolchuk"
            },
            "reviewBody": "To make this even better, I add a few more cloves of garlic , some chopped dill and then whip the potatoes with your hand mixer. Incredible!",
            "datePublished": "2013-11-07T19:29:26.277Z"
