              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "France C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These are your everyday basic mashed potatoes. Nothing bad about them, however I much prefer my potatoes creamier and more flavorful, with added ingredients like butter, sour cream, pepper, etc. It seems the 4 and 5 stars reviewers all added things to the recipe. These also weren't garlicky, so add more garlic if you want to taste it.",
