            "reviewBody": "I cut the recipe in half and speeded things up by putting the potatoes in the microwave. I put the salt, parsley (not fresh), added pepper and a tablespoon of butter in the milk. Stirred that and then added it to the mashed potatoes. Had to play around with the ingredient amounts but we did like it.",
