              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sue"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Like any mashed potato recipe, I think that you have to fiddle with the seasonings and moisture additives (butter, milk, sour cream, etc.) until the taste and texture are to your liking. Myself, I prefer to add my garlic to the cooked potatoes, along with chives, salt, pepper, butter and sour cream. If you're not a big fan of garlic, and/or are trying to watch your fats, this recipe as is looks like a keeper.😄. Just not for everyone, as per the mixed reviews.",
